Testcase: detail that contains conditions & steps & inputs
Testscenerios: detailed document with one liner (No steps & condition & inputs)
Regression: whwenever server updated 
Sanity: Whenever bug fixes 
Smoke : When new build provide +cases
Load : use to measure maximum quantity of users/load it handles
Stress : capture the breaking point/failure point
Alpha : Alpha testing does not involve in-depth testing of the software.Alpha testing is a type of acceptance testing.(This testing performed before the release of the product.)
Beta : (performed absense of tester / presence of real user)Testing performed by the client, stakeholder, and end-user.(Production)Beta testing always is done after the alpha testing, and before releasing it into the market.
Test script:set of instructions
Test suite:collection of Test cases
